## Context

The 2026-07 home-directory reorganization moved every project out of `~`.
The nightbeat supervisor survey (2026-07-11 run) re-pointed six of the seven
`scripts/projects.json` entries to their new locations, but missed cadens
because its new directory name is capitalized — `~/CNRS/papiers/actif/Cadens`,
not the lower-case `cadens` the survey searched for. The entry was removed
under the false premise that no checkout existed anywhere on this machine.

A review pass during PR #493 verification found the live checkout at
`~/CNRS/papiers/actif/Cadens` (origin
`https://github.com/MinhHaDuong/cadens.git`, HEAD 7b55808) and re-registered
it in `scripts/projects.json`.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] cadens has a working checkout registered in `scripts/projects.json`
- [ ] `python3 scripts/nightbeat-supervisor-survey.py` runs warning-free
